  "admin.ai_help.content_inline_edit.body": "1. Select text in title, excerpt, or body.\n2. Press Ctrl+K (Mac: ⌘K) to open the floating editor.\n3. Describe the change (e.g. add compliance details, shorten title).\n4. Preview before/after diff — Accept or Reject.\n5. Repeat until satisfied, then publish.",
  "admin.ai_help.content_modal_ai.body": "While editing content, enter a topic and click Generate with AI to fill title, body, etc. (Chinese draft, no auto-translate).\nUse AI Translate in the translations section for other locales after saving.",
