  "admin.ai_help.ai_console.body": "Pick an Agent mode on the right, then chat:\n• Chatbot: Q&A; optional order context.\n• Plan-Execute-Replan / B2B Coordinator / Trade Assistant: streaming agents.\n• Recommend / Search / Translate / Analyze inquiry / Generate quotation: one-shot JSON.\nFor Chatbot, select an order in the sidebar to discuss that order.",
  "admin.ai_help.xlsx_translate.body": "Upload Excel, choose single or batch translate mode.\nAI translates headers or selected column keys — useful for reports and term sheets.\nDownload the result; try a small sample before batch jobs.",
